<title>USA: Gucci shares up after BusinessWeek report.</title>
<headline>Gucci shares up after BusinessWeek report.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Gucci Group NV were higher on Friday morning after a story in BusinessWeek magazine outlined company plans for boosting its stock price.</p>
<p>According to the story, which appears in the August 4 issue of BusinessWeek, Gucci Chief Executive Domenico de Sole expressed disappointment with the decline in Gucci's share price over the last year.</p>
<p>Among plans for reversing the decline, the story said, are share repurchases, store enlargements and additions, and product line expansions.</p>
<p>Shares in Gucci gained 1-7/8 to 64-11/16 in mid-morning.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk, 212-859-1730))</p>
